{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1761957487_8538675_edc30626904edd46cb85fec124764faa.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p class=\"whitespace-normal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(16,44,87);\"><em><u>Greetings!</u></em></span></strong></p><p class=\"whitespace-normal\" style=\"margin-left:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">We welcome, and seek those on their entrepreneur journey who want to help other entrepreneurs on theirs. At Blueprint Avenue, we embrace the motto <strong><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,255);\">\"</span><em><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,255);\">Build Your Brand\"</span></em></strong><em>!</em> Building your brand is the key to success, and here at Blueprint, we give you just that…the blueprint to start, create, and build your brand the way <em>you</em> see fit!</span></p><p class=\"whitespace-normal\" style=\"margin-left:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Our mission is  to unlock your 12 Chambers…Whether it’s your 12 Chambers of C.R.E.A.M for our affiliates program, or our 12 Chambers of Entrepreneurship series for our fellow entrepreneurs on IG…We want to help you build your 12 Chambers of <em>SUCCESS! </em><em><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,255);\">We Also want to create stunning, unique, and vivid websites to help fresh entrepreneurs stand out from the crowd at an affordable price.</span></em></span></p><p class=\"whitespace-normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(16,44,87);\">Why Partner With Us?</span></strong></span></p><p class=\"whitespace-normal\" style=\"margin-left:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">We've built our affiliate program around the <strong><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,255);\">12 Chambers of C.R.E.A.M</span></strong> for Affiliates…A proven framework that takes you from learning the basics to building your own empire:</span></p><ul><li class=\"whitespace-normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(3,201,136);\">Chamber 1:</span></strong> Learn why every business needs a website</span></li><li class=\"whitespace-normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(3,201,136);\">Chamber 2:</span></strong><span style=\"color:rgb(3,201,136);\"> </span>Master selling these websites</span></li><li class=\"whitespace-normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(3,201,136);\">Chamber 3:</span></strong><span style=\"color:rgb(3,201,136);\"> </span>Stack your affiliate commissions</span></li><li class=\"whitespace-normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(3,201,136);\">Chamber 4:</span></strong> Get your free website</span></li><li class=\"whitespace-normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(3,201,136);\">Chamber 5:</span></strong> Launch your actual business</span></li><li class=\"whitespace-normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(3,201,136);\">Chambers 6-12:</span></strong><span style=\"color:rgb(3,201,136);\"> </span>Build your empire...Most affiliates stop at Chamber 1, but real ones make it to Chamber 12 &amp; beyond</span></li></ul><p class=\"whitespace-normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(16,44,87);\">Your Income Streams (Diversify Your Bonds):</span></strong></span></p><ul style=\"margin-left:20px;\"><li class=\"whitespace-normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(3,201,136);\">Start as an Affiliate (Income Stream 1)</span></strong> – Earn a generous 15% commission on every sale</span></li><li class=\"whitespace-normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(3,201,136);\">Become a Customer (Income Stream 2)</span></strong> – Receive 1 free custom Squarespace template valued up to $150 after your first sale when you're ready</span></li><li class=\"whitespace-normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(3,201,136);\">Build Your Business (Income Stream 3)</span></strong> – Earn one-time referral bonuses ranging from $20-$50, plus an additional 15% commission on every direct \"friend\" referral, <em>and</em> bonuses as your referrals bring in others</span></li><li class=\"whitespace-normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(3,201,136);\">Mentor Others (Income Stream 4)</span></strong> – Unlock monthly bonus commissions ranging from $165-$310 through 3 achievement quests on top of your regular commissions</span></li></ul><p class=\"whitespace-normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(16,44,87);\">The Conversion Funnel:</span></strong></span></p><ul><li class=\"whitespace-normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(3,201,136);\">Stage 1:</span></strong><span style=\"color:rgb(3,201,136);\"> </span>Affiliate Recruitment – Make money promoting custom Squarespace templates</span></li><li class=\"whitespace-normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(3,201,136);\">Stage 2:</span></strong> Success Building – Stack your commissions and learn the business</span></li><li class=\"whitespace-normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(3,201,136);\">Stage 3:</span></strong><span style=\"color:rgb(3,201,136);\"> </span>Business Awakening – Use your money to start your business</span></li><li class=\"whitespace-normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(3,201,136);\">Stage 4:</span></strong> Customer Conversion – Get your free template &amp; launch your empire</span></li><li class=\"whitespace-normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(3,201,136);\">Stage 5:</span></strong> Amplification – Become a case study &amp; mentor others</span></li></ul><p class=\"whitespace-normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(16,44,87);\">What We Offer:</span></strong></span></p><p class=\"whitespace-normal\" style=\"margin-left:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">We specialize in building custom websites using Next.js, React.js, and the Shopify engine, but as an affiliate, you'll earn commission from our Squarespace templates. Your referrals will receive <strong><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,255);\">20% off their first year of hosting and a free domain</span></strong> when they purchase an annual Squarespace Business subscription.</span></p><p class=\"whitespace-normal\" style=\"margin-left:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Our templates cater to a wide range of businesses, including non-profits, beauty brands, professional services like mobile detailing, restaurants/food trucks, and much more!</span></p><p class=\"whitespace-normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(16,44,87);\">Complete Marketing Freedom:</span></strong></span></p><p class=\"whitespace-normal\" style=\"margin-left:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You have complete freedom in how you market…Use our provided materials or direct people to our Instagram (<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,255);\">@blueprint_avenue</span>), where we share entrepreneur tips, showcase our 12 Chambers of Entrepreneurship Series, a quote of the day, and monthly self-help book recommendations.</span></p><p class=\"whitespace-normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(16,44,87);\">Payout Details:</span></strong></span></p><p class=\"whitespace-normal\" style=\"margin-left:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Your earnings will be released on the 1st of each month for all eligible commissions from the previous month.</span></p><p class=\"whitespace-normal\" style=\"margin-left:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,255);\">Don't wait any longer.</span></strong><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,255);\"> </span>Join us today, and let's help turn budding entrepreneurs' dreams into reality - starting with <em>yours</em>.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><br></span></p><p><br></p></div>",
